<title>SYRIA: Syria tenders to buy 13,000 T white sugar.</title>
<headline>Syria tenders to buy 13,000 T white sugar.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Foreign Trade Organisation for Chemicals and Foodstuffs (GEZA) has issued a tender to buy 13,000 tonnes of white sugar, a GEZA spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>September 3 was set as the final date for receiving price offers and results would be given on September 4.</p>
<p>Shipment would be between September 20 and October 20, he said.</p>
</text>
